    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      160.66,
      309.7,
      186.5
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Kandyan Marriage and Divorce (Amendment) Act, No. of 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "MinionPro-Bold",
      "MinionPro-Regular",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      198.26,
      309.48,
      224.1
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 32 of the principal enactment is hereby amended as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "MinionPro-Bold",
      "MinionPro-Regular"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      91.2,
      240.13,
      309.71,
      266.6
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the substitution for paragraph (a), of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      116.2,
      283.73,
      309.72,
      310.2
    ],
    "text": "(a) \u201cAdultery by the husband or wife after marrige.\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      91.2,
      327.33,
      261.63,
      338.8
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the repeal of paragraph (b) thereof.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      351.66,
      309.49,
      377.5
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "MinionPro-Bold",
      "MinionPro-Regular"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
